## Summary of Changes

| File | Change |
|------|--------|
| `src/router/index.ts` | ✅ Added `/chats`, `/chats/:chatId/:chatName`, `/chats/:chatId/:chatName/workspace/:workspaceId/:workspaceName` routes |
| | ✅ Added `/workspaces`, `/workspaces/:workspaceId/:workspaceName` routes |
| | ✅ Kept `/desktop/:pathMatch(.*)*` unchanged |
| `src/router/navigate.js` | ✅ Added `$navigator.chats.list()`, `open()`, `openWithWorkspace()` |
| | ✅ Added `$navigator.workspaces.list()`, `open()` |
| | ✅ Mode detection: `isDesktopMode` determines UI store vs router behavior |
| `src/views/WorkspaceView.vue` | ✅ Created new file with list and detail views |
| `src/views/QuickChatView.vue` | ✅ Updated to use `$router.$navigate.chats.*` methods |

**Key Features:**
- ✅ All navigation centralized in `navigate.js`
- ✅ Desktop mode uses `ui.showApp()`, Router mode uses `$router.push()`
- ✅ No workspace context preservation (as requested)
- ✅ Proper route structure with nested workspaces in chats

