# Navigation API Enhancement

I'll create a comprehensive Navigation API that manages all router changes with proper state exposure and methods. Let me implement this step by step.

## Changes Summary

| File | Changes |
|------|---------|
| `src/router/navigate.js` | Complete rewrite with all navigation methods and state getters |
| `src/components/layout/DesktopSidebar.vue` | Update to use `$navigation` API |
| `src/components/layout/MobileBottomBar.vue` | Update to use `$navigation` API |
| `src/store/chats.js` | Update `setActiveChat` to use `$navigation` |
| `src/views/QuickChatView.vue` | Update workspace app handling to use `$navigation` |
| `src/router/index.ts` | Update to use new Navigation API |

