## Summary of Changes

| File | What Changed |
|------|--------------|
| `navigate.js` | **Complete rewrite**: Added comprehensive Navigation API with state getters (`getChatId()`, `getWorkspaceId()`, etc), route flags (`isChatView`, `isDesktopMode`, etc), and all navigation methods |
| `DesktopSidebar.vue` | Updated all `handleNavClick` to use `$storex.$router.navigation.*` methods, removed direct `$router.push` calls |
| `MobileBottomBar.vue` | Updated navigation methods to use Navigation API |
| `chats.js` | Updated `setActiveChat` to call `navigation.navigateToChat()` |
| `QuickChatView.vue` | Updated workspace selection to use `addWorkspaceToChat()` and `navigateToWorkspace()` |
| `router/index.ts` | Expose `navigation` on router instance |

All components now use `$storex.$router.navigation` for all routing operations! 🎯

