## Key Changes

✅ **Removed circular dependency**:
- `navigate.js` no longer receives `$storex` as parameter
- Uses lazy getters with `this.$storex` to access store only when needed
- Store is accessed via `window.__storex__` (set by store initialization)

✅ **Router-only initialization**:
- Navigation only depends on `$router`
- Store imports router without issues
- `$storex.$router` can be set after store initialization without circular issues

✅ **Same API**:
- All methods remain unchanged
- Components still use `$storex.$router.navigation.*` methods
- Works seamlessly with existing code

